S","strName":"否极我全勤，泰来他人占！","strDescription":"在最终复活投点中失败","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/282800/7d6ca4e45f81333f1124272d0ab438a9450d0a98.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":26.600000381469727,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_MP_MADDASH","strName":"疯狂冲刺","strDescription":"跑得飞快","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/282800/1467884bc26e6c2d9462310364d64d4d955e72ef.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":26.5,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_BINDER_25","strName":"扩展包","strDescription":"收集 25% 的卡片","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/282800/7d8c13952e99c783d1f3530acfbd0b171d6bac86.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":24.299999237060547,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_SURVIVE_ATTACK","strName":"绝对防御","strDescription":"在面对 9 点或以上攻击的情况下存活","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/282800/27c7c6b949fb42e50a427c7ccd678263886ac046.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":23.100000381469727,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ACH_TRAP_LEVELING","strName":"然后他就不见了","strDescription":"使用陷阱卡阻止敌人升级","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/282800/3e6faf86c03f8075574ef9a7acb53391f7c41cf4.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":20.200000762939453,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":353,"nAchieved":0}}],["workshop_trendy_items",{"version":2}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Orange_Juice","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/fruitbatfactory"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Fruitbat Factory","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/fruitbatfactory"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Orange Juice","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/oj-universe"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"100% Orange Juice（100%鲜橙汁）是橙汁系列作品全明星登场的桌面游戏。与来自Flying Red Barrel（飞天红酒桶）、QP Shooting（QP追击）、Suguri（疾旋战姬）、Sora（空旋战姬）各个作品里的角色，以及在本作中出现的新角色们，一起以获胜为目标使用骰子对战吧！\r\n\r\n小狗、人类与机械在天空中飞翔交汇的世界。\r\n在这个世界里，诞生了一小片漆黑的暗影。\r\n最初还非常渺小的暗影逐渐笼罩了整个世界……\r\n\r\n青年Kai（凯），在迷之生物Marie Poppo（玛丽啵噗）的指引下，开始了一个将会穿越数个世界的旅途。\r\n漆黑又无尽的欲望之暗，渐渐侵食着Kai（凯）与世界本身……\r\n\r\n让Marie Poppo（玛丽啵噗）带你进入这神秘的世界一起游玩吧。构筑你的卡组开始游戏吧！\r\n\r\n[h2]游戏特色[/h2]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]骰子、卡片、星星、战斗和布丁\r\n[*]单人剧情战役×4\r\n[*]支持最大4人的联机对战\r\n[*]无数的战斗策略\r\n[*]活用各个角色的能力来战斗吧\r\n[*]超过50种的卡片\r\n[*]使用Hyper卡发挥角色最大的力量吧\r\n[/list]\r\n\r\n[h2]Steam版特色[/h2]\r\n[list]\r\n[*]全高清支持\r\n[*]使用Steam大厅系统重新设计的多人体验\r\n[*]观战模式\r\n[*]自定义虚拟形象\r\n[*]满足条件可解锁新的角色皮肤\r\n[*]VAC反作弊\r\n[*]自定义语言支持\r\n[/list]","strSnippet":"100%鲜橙汁是橙汁系列作品全明星登场的桌面游戏。与来自各个橙汁作品里的角色，以及在本作中出现的新角色们，一起以获胜为目标使用骰子对战吧！"}}]]